        "cooked": "<p>Okay, I’ve got to admit. Possibly my favorite trhing ever is the numerous anti-climaxes baron blade has experienced.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>First there was his mad bomber plot. He had spent years perfecting it and getting everything reqdy. Then, he finally enacts it in all it’s supervillain glamour and how do the freedom five react? They can’t because they’re on mars fighting an Alien Invasion.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>second theres his plan that would eventually kill one of the legacies in other timelines. It fails because both Legacies are in the hospital due to Iron Legacy showing up. Thanks a lot Angry Paul.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>(sorry about interrupting the sadness with comedy)</p>",
